        "$n = 1$：$T_1 = 3$，$T_2 = 3.1$，估计误差 $\\dfrac{|3.1-3|}{3} = 3.333\\times10^{-2}$；真误差 $|\\pi-3.1| = 4.159\\times10^{-2}$。",
        "$n = 2$：$T_2 = 3.1$，$T_4 = 3.1311765$，估计 $1.039\\times10^{-2}$；真误差 $1.042\\times10^{-2}$。",
